{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-act-15-1","title":"Acts 15:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Great dissensions arise touching circumcision. 5 The apostles consult about it, 22 and send their determination by letters to the churches. 36 Paul and Barnabas, thinking to visit the brethren together, disagree, and travel different ways.</p>\n<p>Cir. A.M. 4057. A.D. 53. certain. 21:20; Ga 2:4,12,13 the brethren. 23 Except. 5; Ro 4:8-12; Ga 5:1-4; Php 3:2,3; Col 2:8,11,12,16 after. Ge 17:10-27; Le 12:3; Joh 7:22 ye. 24; 1Co 7:18,19; Ga 2:1,3; 5:6; 6:13-16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-15-2","title":"Acts 15:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Paul. 7; Ga 1:6-10; 2:5; Jude 1:3 they determined. 25; Ex 18:23; Ga 2:1,2 certain. 22,27; 10:23; 11:12 should. 4,22,23; 1Sa 8:7; 1Co 9:19-23; Ga 2:2; Phm 1:8,9 the apostles. 6,23; 21:18; 1Co 1:1; 2Co 11:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-15-3","title":"Acts 15:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>brought. 21:5; 28:15; Ro 15:24; 1Co 16:6,11; Tit 3:13; 3Jo 1:6-8 passed. 8:14; 11:19 declaring. 12; 14:27; 21:19,20 they caused. 11:18; 13:48,52; Isa 60:4,5; 66:12-14; Lu 15:5-10,23,24,32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-15-4","title":"Acts 15:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>received. 18:27; 21:17; Mt 10:40; Ro 15:7; Col 4:10; 2Jo 1:10; 3Jo 1:8-10 all. 3,12; 14:27; 21:19; Ro 15:18; 1Co 15:10; 2Co 5:19; 6:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-act-15-5","title":"Acts 15:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ACT","chapterStart":15,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":15,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>rose up certain. or, rose up, said they, certain. the sect. 21:20; 26:5,6; Php 3:5-8 That